From 19b59325103daecc828d2e01bdd96fb99c5df1c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Clarke <sanity@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Mar 2026 22:39:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 11/69] feat(ui,cli): expose all room config fields + rebuild
 stale WASM

Add room description editing and numeric config fields (max message
size, max nickname size, max user bans, max room name/description size)
to the UI edit room modal. Add --name, --description, and corresponding
--max-* flags to the CLI room config command, and display all fields
when no flags are given.

Rebuild room_contract.wasm and chat_delegate.wasm which were stale
since the freenet-stdlib 0.1.40 bump (Feb 27). Delegate migration
entry V3 already covers the previously deployed delegate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
